  nodeId: The Politics
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "<b>Detective Miller:</b>\r\n\"The city council is terrified. They want
    to avoid a high-society scandal that could freeze the art trade. They're forcing
    the 'suicide due to financial distress' verdict by the end of the day. Oversight
    assigned us as a two-person team to find the truth before local politics can
    bury the case for good.\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r"
